{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gravebound is a post-apocalyptic shooter extraction game that fuses fast-paced gunplay with light survival mechanics and hardcore extraction. Explore the shattered earth, scavenge for powerful gear, battle relentless robots, and face off against other players in a high-stakes fight for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt for crystals capable of immense power, engage in tense firefights with robots hellbent on destroying humanity, and beware other scavengers in your path. But every excursion comes with a choice: push deeper for greater rewards or extract and live to fight another day.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shooter Extraction Gameplay</strong><br>Load in solo or with a squad. Scavenge, fight, and extract \u2014 or risk it all for the best loot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Post-Apocalyptic World</strong><br>A unique setting where crumbling cities and powerful elements collide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PvPvE Combat</strong><br>Face off against other players and AI-controlled robots and bosses \u2014 every encounter is a deadly choice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource collection System</strong> <br>Find and extract the rare crystal - use it in the makeshift tech stations for upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Risk-Reward Extraction</strong><br>Extract safely or dive deeper for the most powerful loot \u2014 but beware, death means losing everything you carry.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3613050?t=1755802074","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613050/cffc347567a1c4e1d95475ad3566e3bd1b68b3b7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755802074","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamst